So I asked, "Please make a Towa song that makes the absolute most of that,"

481
00:33:54,062 --> 00:33:57,562
できた曲が、『SMASH IT UP』なんですよね。
and the song that was born was "SMASH IT UP."

482
00:33:57,862 --> 00:34:00,862
うーん。結構ね、
Yeah. It's quite...

